HB0143 LaPrele dam rebuilding.
Sponsored By: Representative(s) Yin and Senator(s) Gierau
AN ACT relating to water development projects; increasing the grant provided to
the Laprele dam rehabilitation project; transferring funds from the legislative
stabilization reserve account to water development account II; and providing
for an effective date.
